Source: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Heretek Games <contact@heretek.games>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/Heretek-Games/drop
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libayatana-appindicator3-1, xdg-utils
Description: @APP_SUMMARY@
 Drop is an open-source, self-hosted game library and distribution platform.
 This desktop client connects to your Drop server instance to download,
 manage, update, and launch your games with native Proton/Wine and emulator support.
